ss of when\n    #5839 lands (risk-reduction work with independent value for the auth flow).\n- **Tier 2 (gated on the upstream outcome)**:\n  - E002 — the llmisvc-controller standalone KEDA path; consumes upstream #5839 (merged) or\n    the downstream patch carry selected by E001.\n  - E004 — documentation of what was built (blocked by all implementations per Rule 11).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":34119,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b5a4845098be9430","agent_id":"a4eeb449d7b52be09","session_id":"c67b7b09-8e50-4c38-b7b7-230c45313c19","uuid":"5307ceea-dd7d-466b-89e7-83660a3fc1ef","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:23:53.776Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8008"}
