ewayReconciler manages Gateway API resources, Kuadrant AuthPolicies, Istio EnvoyFilters, and PodMonitors for the LLM gateway ingress path. A conditional prometheus-operator watch allows the controller to degrade gracefully when monitoring CRDs are absent. [source: cmd/main.go:89-177, internal/controller/serving/inferenceservice_controller.go:208-219, internal/controller/serving/llm/gateway_controller.go:1003-1062]\n37:| Downstream | https://github.com/red-hat-data-services/odh-model-controller | auto_merge | main | `sync-manifests-to-kserve.yml` | local_analysis |\n90:| /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1alpha1-inferencegraph | POST |  | HTTPS | Unknown | TLS | Kubernetes admission |  | Mutating admission webhook |\n91:| /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1alpha1-llminferenceservice | POST |  | HTTPS | Unknown | TLS | Kubernetes admission |  | Mutating admission webhook |\n92:| /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1alpha2-llminferenceservice | POST |  | HTTPS | Unknown | TLS | Kubernetes admission |  | Mutating admission webhook |\n93:| /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice | POST |  | HTTPS | Unknown | TLS | Kubernetes admission |  | Mutating admission webhook |\n97:| /validate-serving-kserve-io-v1alpha1-inferencegraph | POST |  | HTTPS | Unknown | TLS | Kubernetes admission |  | Validating admission webhook |\n98:| /validate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice | POST |  | HTTPS | Unknown | TLS | Kubernetes admission |  | Validating admission webhook |\n118:| github.com/kserve/kserve | v0.17.0-rc1 | Yes |  | Go module dependency |\n166:| KServe InferenceService | CRD Watch | runtime-integration | Read model serving state |\n168:| KServe InferenceService | Controller watch | runtime-integration | Read model serving state |\n201:| kserve-prometheus-k8s |  | endpoints, pods, services | get, list, watch |\n228:| odh-model-controller-role | serving.kserve.io | inferencegraphs, llminferenceserviceconfigs | get, list, watch |\n229:| odh-model-controller-role | serving.kserve.io | inferencegraphs/finalizers, servingruntimes/finalizers | update |\n230:| odh-model-controller-role | serving.kserve.io | inferenceservices | get, list, patch, update, watch |\n231:| odh-model-controller-role | serving.kserve.io | inferenceservices/finalizers | create, delete, get, list, patch, update, watch |\n232:| odh-model-controller-role | serving.kserve.io | llminferenceservices | get, list, patch, post, update, watch |\n233:| odh-model-controller-role | serving.kserve.io | llminferenceservices/finalizers | patch, update |\n234:| odh-model-controller-role | serving.kserve.io | llminferenceservices/status | get, patch, update |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a5a5a0b7b204004c","agent_id":"a789eec0caf1fe383","session_id":"c67b7b09-8e50-4c38-b7b7-230c45313c19","uuid":"14a6f4b4-7fba-4636-b690-f1e2df0794e4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T12:33:48.461Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-aa11ecc2e37c8912","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8008 decomposition"}
